error: the union `int | str` is not supported
 --> main.ty:2:8
  |
2 |     n: int | str = 1
  |        ^^^^^^^^^ only `T | None` may be written as a union
  |
  = note: typhoon's only union is `T | None`, see DESIGN.md section 3.10
  = help: use `T | None` for a value that may be absent, or a class to hold the alternatives
